<Site title="About Marv" description="Meet Marv Pacinabao, a landing page and funnel builder with two years of experience and a background in aircraft maintenance." active="about"><section class="wrap page-intro"><p class="section-context">About me</p><h1>A builder’s mind.<br>A careful pair of hands.</h1><p>I build landing pages and storefronts, and support the funnels around them. My work spans Shopify, WordPress and Elementor, GoHighLevel, and Funnelish.</p></section><section class="wrap about-body"><div class="experience-panel"><div class="about-monogram" aria-hidden="true">mp.</div><span>Marv Pacinabao</span><p>Two years building pages.<br>A longer habit of figuring things out.</p><a class="button button-white" href="/resume/">View my résumé </a></div><div class="about-story"><h2>Care in the small things.</h2><p>My earlier career was in aircraft maintenance, where precision and a systematic approach matter. That experience still shapes how I approach a build: pay attention, work through the details and understand how the pieces fit together.</p><p>Today, my work ranges from a custom Shopify storefront for ORIAS Essentials to product advertorials for ARTIN, Cowmit and BALZY. I’ve also built WordPress pages for Zenith and supported GHL-connected funnels for Vendrato.</p><a class="text-link" href="/aviation/">My aviation background </a></div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>The work I bring to a team.</h2></div><div class="background-grid"><article><h3>Pages &amp; storefronts</h3><p>Shopify storefronts and advertorials, plus WordPress and Elementor landing pages.</p></article><article><h3>Ecommerce support</h3><p>Product-page updates, Funnelish changes, translations, QA and campaign support for a Sweden-based brand.</p></article><article><h3>Connected funnels</h3><p>GoHighLevel CRM, booking and lead-capture flows that support service enquiries.</p></article></div></section><ContactBand/></Site>
